---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/support-pages.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="EPA Section 608 Study Resource | HVAC Training Solutions" description="Open the archived HVAC Training Solutions EPA study PDF and find current official Section 608 certification and testing information.">
  <div class="support-page">
    <section class="support-hero"><div class="support-shell">
      <p class="support-eyebrow">Free study resource</p>
      <h1>EPA Section 608 study.</h1>
      <p class="support-lead">Download the original study PDF, then check the EPA’s current certification requirements and approved testing programs.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="support-section"><div class="support-shell">
      <div class="epa-resource"><div><p class="support-eyebrow">Archived PDF</p><h2>Start with the resource, then verify what changed.</h2><p>The original 66-page PDF was created in 2011 and is preserved at its longstanding address. It has not been updated for current refrigerants, rules, or exam topics. Treat it as historical study material.</p></div><div class="epa-resource-links"><a class="button button-primary" href="/EPA.pdf">Open EPA study PDF ↗</a><a class="support-inline-link" href="https://www.epa.gov/section608/section-608-technician-certification-requirements">Current EPA requirements ↗</a><a class="support-inline-link" href="https://www.epa.gov/section608/certification-programs-section-608-technicians">EPA-approved testing programs ↗</a></div></div>
      <p class="resource-location-note">HVAC Training Solutions does not administer the EPA certification test. Follow an EPA-approved certifying organization for current exams.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="support-section support-section-soft support-last"><div class="support-shell support-next-step"><div><p class="support-eyebrow">New to HVAC?</p><h2>Need the wider picture?</h2><p>Explore the existing HVAC Boot Camp course for the fundamentals of heating and cooling systems.</p></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/hvac-boot-camp/">Explore Boot Camp</a></div></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
